                    "_type": "Diesel Product Footer",
                    "copy": "Copyright © 2020 Kalypso Media Group GmbH. Tropico is a registered trade mark of Kalypso Media Group GmbH. All rights reserved. Published by Kalypso Media Group GmbH. Developed by Haemimont Games. All other logos, copyrights and trademarks are property of their respective owners.",
